    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "VIEWING ONE OF THE CLIPPER SHIPS WITH\nSAN FRANCISCO-OAKLAND BAY BRIDGE\nIN BACKGROUND\nEvery Wednesday afternoon one of the big Pan Ameri-\nFlying Clippers heads out Westward over\nine Guiden Gale. Each Tuesday morning another Clipper\npasses Eastward toward the seaplane base at Alameda.\nnamed the China\nClipper, Hawaii\nPhilippine Clipper make 8200-mile journey to Manila,\nby way of Honolulu, in 60 flying hours.\nFOR CORRESPONDENCE\nPOST CARD\nTHIS SPACE FOR ADDRESS ONLY\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE"
    ],
